  description: Known to inhabit the uncharted lands of the far north, he lives undisturbed
    with his team of elves, working day and night to prepare gifts for the children
    of Grand Gaia. Only a few lucky souls will catch a glimpse of him so keep your
    eyes peeled on the night of Christmas Eve.
  summonDesc: Ho ho ho!! You saved Christmas from the evil witch and the Grinch!
